OL,3,GNEWSAMan passes GCSE maths 70 years
OL,4,Aafter failing
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 86-year-old man dedicated to keeping
OL,7,Fhis "mind active" has passed his GCSE
OL,8,Fin mathematics, 70 years after first
OL,9,Ffailing it in school.
OL,11,FBrian Jones, who lives in Fairwater in
OL,12,FCwmbran, achieved a grade C after
OL,13,Fstudying through Torfaen Adult
OL,14,FCommunity Learning - and now plans to
OL,15,Ftake his English GCSE.
OL,17,FHe had initially failed the subject in
OL,18,F1956 and always planned to retake it
OL,19,Fbut "life took over".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
